Assemble over Nauvis
Load up 1000 Ice (or more- you decide), as well as 50 solar panels into a rocket and blast it up to the Von Braun. There’s a filtered inserter that will unload the ice.
You should be ready in abar 30 minutes
Prime the fuel and oxidizer tanks (Uncheck the “Enable/disable” checkbox on each pump and wait for the pipes to fill, then check it again. You’ll only really have to do this, this one time)
You should have about 3K in the water tanks by then, so move to Gleba and park it there for a while to stock up on rockets and some other stuff.
Once rockets are stocked up, take your first trip to Aquilo and park there so that the tanks get to something respectable, like 10K. (From then on, you don’t have to worry about the water tanks anymore, they will fill up eventually)
